 \\,$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 2.3263 \\,$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\n*In addition, you're given the following table of values for $p = \\Phi(z)$*.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\"> <th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$z$</th><th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$\\, 0.05 \\,$</th><th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$\\, 0.06 \\,$</th><th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$\\, 0.07 \\,$</th>\n</tr><tr data-next-row=\"true\"> <th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$\\, 0.2 \\,$</th><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.5987 \\,$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.6026 \\,$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.6064 \\,$</td></tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\"> <th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$\\, 0.3 \\,$</th><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.6368 \\,$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.6406 \\,$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.6443 \\,$</td></tr>\n<tr> <th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$\\, 0.4 \\,$</th><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.6736 \\,$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.6772 \\,$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$\\, 0.6808 \\,$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n"] [:db/cas 17592186083515 :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f$ defined by the following table?\n\n| $x$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $f(x)$ | $0$ | $-3$ | $1$ | $2$ | $-1$ | $4$ |" "What is the range of the function $f$ defined by the following table?\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\" dat